"1_1": {
"dialogue": "RAWR xd",
"offset": Vector2(-1500, -300),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": ""
},
"1_10": {
"dialogue": "Aqua's experiments are just in this room here.",
"offset": Vector2(-1760, 3440),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_11": {
"dialogue": "I have a friend, Basil, who seems to have wandered off. The aforementioned Green man. Would you help me find them?",
"offset": Vector2(80, 100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_12",
"text": "Of course"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_16",
"text": "What do you need me for?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 290),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_12": {
"dialogue": "Your kindness is most appreciated.",
"offset": Vector2(760, 120),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_33",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_16": {
"dialogue": "In truth, my offer is more for you than me. This island is filled with monsters. It would be unkind to leave you to their mercy. ",
"offset": Vector2(420, 400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_17",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_17": {
"dialogue": "Helping you is what Basil would do.",
"offset": Vector2(762.121, 398.358),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_33",
"text": "Oh, thanks"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 257),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_2": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-1500, -620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": ""
},
"1_20": {
"dialogue": "",
"offset": Vector2(-2260, 4040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_21": {
"dialogue": "When combatants transmute, there are side effects that alter our stats.",
"offset": Vector2(-1700, 1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_23",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_23": {
"dialogue": "When you go from:
[ul][color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Speed boost.[/ul]
[ul][color=red]Offensive[/color] -> [color=blue]Defensive[/color] = Defense boost.[/ul]
[ul] [color=blue]Defensive[/color] -> [color=red]Offensive[/color] = Attack boost.[/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1360, 1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_26",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_24": {
"dialogue": "Defensive Types:
[ul][el]Blue[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Cyan[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Magenta[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Yellow[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1460, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_25",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_25": {
"dialogue": "Offensive Types:
[ul][el]Green[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Purple[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Orange[/el][/ul]
[ul][el]Red[/el][/ul]",
"offset": Vector2(-1120, 2000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_26": {
"dialogue": "The 3rd tab in your transmutation menu shows this information in detail.",
"offset": Vector2(-1020, 1260),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_27": {
"dialogue": "Now I have 2 more things to show you.",
"offset": Vector2(-1920, 2400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_28",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_28": {
"dialogue": "You probably noticed that I have 2  colors, while the opponent only has 1.",
"offset": Vector2(-1580, 2400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_29",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_29": {
"dialogue": "The first 2 rows of a transmutation hint shows how those 2 types will react to an attack.",
"offset": Vector2(-1240, 2400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_41",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_3": {
"dialogue": "You just washed up on the beach, didn't you. ",
"offset": Vector2(-1960, 100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_30": {
"dialogue": "Since you were able to bypass Aqua's little experiments on the beach, I assume you have a basic understanding of the transmutation system. But should you need a reminder, you can press 'T' to view the menu.",
"offset": Vector2(-1700, 940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_31",
"text": "Just like in the overworld, the the elements will react with one another."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 265),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_31": {
"dialogue": " Unlike Aqua's little blocks, however, combatants can have 2 types.",
"offset": Vector2(-1357.15, 942.636),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_32",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_32": {
"dialogue": "Select an attack from the menu below. I suggest selecting [el]Purple Hit[/el].",
"offset": Vector2(-1018.75, 942.241),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_40",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_33": {
"dialogue": " I'm sure Basil will not be found on the beach. Let's move Northward.",
"offset": Vector2(1200, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_34",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_34": {
"dialogue": " Here, take these. They'll help you against what is to come.[br][br]Player obtained [el]Magenta[/el] Strike!",
"offset": Vector2(1540, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_35",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_35": {
"dialogue": "I must warn you. Up ahead, there is a dangerous foe. A large slime. We'll have to fight it.",
"offset": Vector2(1880, 240),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_36",
"text": "I don't know how to fight! (Start battle tutorial)"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_37",
"text": "Is that safe?"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_38",
"text": "Let's do it!"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 323),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_36": {
"dialogue": "Then I will teach you.",
"offset": Vector2(2240, 80),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"9_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_37": {
"dialogue": "We will win. But if you'd like, the slimes in the enxt room should act as a weaker version.",
"offset": Vector2(2243.14, 382.947),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_38": {
"dialogue": "Your enthusiasm... You will get along well with Basil.",
"offset": Vector2(2240, 700),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_39": {
"dialogue": "Ah, here we go",
"offset": Vector2(2900, 80),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"3_2",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_4": {
"dialogue": "Tell me, did you see a large, green man down that way?",
"offset": Vector2(-1620, 100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": "No..."
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 257),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_40": {
"dialogue": "If you hover your mouse over the opponent, you'll be shown the Transmutation hint. For now, simply remember the color in the top-right square.",
"offset": Vector2(-660, 940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": 0
},
"1_41": {
"dialogue": "You may have guessed what the 3rd row is hinting to you, but if not watch how my typing reacts to the opponent's next attack.",
"offset": Vector2(-900, 2400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_42": {
"dialogue": "So not only will your typing react to your opponent's attacks (and vice versa), but your primary and secondary types can react together!",
"offset": Vector2(-1920, 2700),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_43",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_43": {
"dialogue": "Finally, just one more thing.
[br][br]So far, we've only been using [i]ranged[/i] attacks. Watch what happens when the opponent uses a melee attack instead.",
"offset": Vector2(-1580, 2700),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
"1_44": {
"dialogue": "But more importantly, using a ranged attack will only affect your opponent's typing. However, melee attacks will affect both the target and the user.",
"offset": Vector2(-1560, 3020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 240),
"speaker": "Partner"
},
